# Vercel detects the package.json "start" script (node dist/index.mjs) and
# runs this as a persistent Node.js server, not serverless /api functions -
# so dist/ (pre-built, committed directly like a normal deploy artifact) must
# stay visible. Everything else here is genuinely unused at runtime.
